# ShowTrack configuration
#
# ShowTrack uses The Movie Database (TMDB) as its show database for search,
# posters, episodes and runtimes. Create a free API key at
# https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api and paste it below.
#
# WITHOUT a key the app still runs in "Demo mode" using a small bundled
# sample library, so you can explore the full interface. Add a key to unlock
# real search and full TV Time imports.

VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
